ity rows</th><th>Finite bound sides</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>LIPMWALK</td><td>30</td><td>16</td><td>0</td><td>32</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>WHLIPBAL</td><td>30</td><td>50</td><td>0</td><td>100</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>QUADCMPC1</td><td>1</td><td>768</td><td>384</td><td>512</td><td>512</td></tr><tr><td>QUADCMPC2</td><td>1</td><td>576</td><td>288</td><td>384</td><td>384</td></tr><tr><td>QUADCMPC3</td><td>1</td><td>384</td><td>192</td><td>256</td><td>128</td></tr><tr><td>QUADCMPC4</td><td>1</td><td>384</td><td>192</td><td>256</td><td>256</td></tr><tr><td>G1SP20</td><td>1</td><td>18549</td><td>0</td><td>230</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>G1CMCTWO</td><td>1</td><td>106836</td><td>0</td><td>378</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>G1SPFULL</td><td>1</td><td>193566</td><td>0</td><td>2437</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table"><table><thead><tr><th>Solver</th><th>Method</th><th>Configuration</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>DAQP</td><td>Dual active set</td><td>Recursive LDLᵀ updates; dense MPC only; version 0.8.7 uses selective proximal regularization for weak curvature</td></tr><tr><td>GTSAM Dense Dual</td><td>Dual active set</td><td>Native positive-definite Hessian Cholesky when eligible; equality reduction and square-root fallback otherwise; LDLᵀ working updates, original-coordinate refinement and KKT checks; MPC and G1, with retained G1 timings</td></tr><tr><td>GTSAM Sparse Dual</td><td>Dual active set</td><td>Zero-multiplier cold start; equality elimination through cached sparse constrained solves; working LDLᵀ updates and original-coordinate refinement; proximal weight 1e-9 on MPC, zero additional regularization on G1; MPC and G1</td></tr><tr><td>ProxQP</td><td>Proximal primal-dual augmented Lagrangian</td><td>Solves regularized subproblems with semismooth Newton inner iterations</td></tr><tr><td>Clarabel</td><td>Interior point</td><td>Primal-dual interior-point steps toward the constrained optimum</td></tr><tr><td>OSQP</td><td>Operator splitting (ADMM)