+    "## Evidence\n",
+    "\n",
+    "Language models answer confidently, often with probabilities of exactly 0 or 1. A factor value of 0 makes\n",
+    "a mode impossible, so the geometry could never overrule it. We therefore clip the probabilities to\n",
+    "$[\\epsilon, 1-\\epsilon]$ with a floor $\\epsilon$ that is revisited at the end."
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 6,
+   "id": "010ae34c",
+   "metadata": {
